{"timestamp": 1783629045.59605, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 10, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1783629045.597404, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 10, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1783629050.257099, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I found Alice\u2019s body in electrical. My route was storage -> medbay -> electrical. I didn\u2019t actually run into anyone directly this round, but I did see Frank leave medbay toward upper_engine around T7. I didn\u2019t see who was in electrical before I got there, so I can\u2019t accuse anyone yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629059.683707, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started upper_engine, went to oxygen, then came back to upper_engine. I saw Frank enter upper_engine from the medbay direction at around T9, so that lines up with Eve saying she saw him leaving medbay toward upper_engine. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all this round, and I didn\u2019t see Charlie or Diana either.\n\nI can\u2019t clear Frank for before T9, but I can confirm he was in upper_engine by then. I don\u2019t have enough to accuse anyone yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629066.4403021, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I went navigation -> security -> weapons. The important thing I saw is Charlie: at around T6, Charlie entered security coming from electrical.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Alice myself, and I didn\u2019t go into electrical, so I can\u2019t confirm when she died. But since Eve found the body in electrical, Charlie was definitely coming from that direction earlier in the round. Frank\u2019s medbay to upper_engine path seems backed up by both Eve and Bob, so I\u2019m more interested in hearing Charlie\u2019s route and whether they saw Alice in electrical."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629074.965662, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I did start in electrical, then went to security, and Diana seeing me come in around T6 is accurate.\n\nIn electrical I saw Frank there at T2, then Alice entered from cafeteria around T3. At T3/T4, both Frank and Alice were in electrical with me. Alice was alive when I last saw her. I left electrical for security after that and saw Diana enter security from navigation around T6.\n\nSo from my point of view, the key thing is: Alice was alive in electrical with me and Frank, then I left. I don\u2019t know what Frank did immediately after, but Eve and Bob both place him going medbay -> upper_engine later, which means he could have left electrical after me. I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but Frank was the last person I personally saw with Alice in the room where the body was found."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629090.62473, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Yeah, Charlie\u2019s timeline is mostly right, but the framing is a little convenient.\n\nI went medbay -> electrical, saw Charlie there, then Alice came in from cafeteria. Charlie left toward security, and I stayed briefly, then left electrical back to medbay. Alice was alive when I left her. Eve seeing me in medbay around T7 and Bob seeing me reach upper_engine after that matches my route \u2014 I didn\u2019t loop back to electrical.\n\nSo if the body was found in electrical after that, the window is after I left. Eve is the one who went medbay -> electrical and found it, and nobody saw her directly before the report. I\u2019m not hard accusing Eve either, but I don\u2019t think \u201cFrank was in electrical early\u201d is enough when two people place me away from electrical later. My suspicion is more on whoever had access to electrical after I left, including possibly a self-report."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629109.47135, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019ll restate clearly: I found Alice dead in electrical after going storage -> medbay -> electrical. I didn\u2019t see anyone directly in electrical before finding the body, and I reported immediately.\n\nThe only movement I personally saw was Frank leaving medbay toward upper_engine around T7, which Bob also backs up later. But based on everyone\u2019s stories, the only people confirmed in electrical with Alice were Charlie and Frank. Diana confirms Charlie came from electrical into security around T6, and Bob/me confirm Frank was away from electrical later.\n\nSo I don\u2019t think this is enough to clear either Charlie or Frank. Frank could\u2019ve killed before going medbay -> upper_engine, or Charlie could be lying about when Alice was alive. I don\u2019t have a hard accusation, but I think the vote should be between Charlie and Frank, not random."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629126.260043, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "From my side, I can only confirm the end of Frank\u2019s route: I was upper_engine -> oxygen -> back to upper_engine, and at T9 Frank entered upper_engine from the medbay direction. That matches Eve seeing him leave medbay around T7.\n\nBut I want to be clear: that does **not** clear Frank for what happened before T7. If Charlie\u2019s and Frank\u2019s stories are both mostly true, then Frank was the one who stayed in electrical with Alice after Charlie left. Diana confirms Charlie coming into security around T6, so Charlie\u2019s exit from electrical has a witness.\n\nEve self-report is possible in theory, but the strongest opportunity right now seems like Frank killing in electrical, leaving to medbay, then being seen by Eve and me afterward. I\u2019m leaning Frank unless someone has a better contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629139.918769, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I want to emphasize what I can actually confirm: I saw Charlie enter security from electrical around T6. So Charlie definitely left electrical and came to security at that point.\n\nGiven the body was in electrical, the cleanest timeline to me is that Charlie leaves, Frank stays behind with Alice, then Frank is seen leaving medbay toward upper_engine shortly after. That path fits with killing in electrical, leaving through medbay, then being seen by Eve and Bob.\n\nEve self-report is possible, but it feels weaker because both Charlie and Frank put Alice alive in electrical earlier, and Frank is the one who admits he stayed after Charlie left. My strongest suspicion is Frank right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629149.292934, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Diana\u2019s confirmation is important here: I left electrical and went into security around T6, and she saw me come in from electrical. My own timeline is electrical -> security, with Frank in electrical at T2-T4 and Alice entering at T3. Alice was alive when I last saw her.\n\nFrank\u2019s own story says he stayed in electrical after I left, with Alice still there, then went through medbay and got seen by Eve and Bob later. That gives him the cleanest opportunity: kill after I leave, exit through medbay, then be seen away from the scene.\n\nI agree self-report is technically possible, but based on confirmed movements, Frank is the strongest suspect. I\u2019m voting Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1783629166.3054311, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I get why it looks bad, but people are treating \u201cI stayed after Charlie\u201d as if that proves the kill, and it doesn\u2019t.\n\nThe key detail from my side is: Alice was still alive when I left electrical. I went straight electrical -> medbay, and Eve sees me in medbay at T7, then Bob sees me in upper_engine after. I did not go back to electrical.\n\nEve\u2019s route is exactly medbay -> electrical, and she admits nobody saw her directly before the report. So from the confirmed info, she is literally the next person going into electrical after I\u2019m seen leaving medbay. A self-report is absolutely possible here.\n\nAlso, Charlie is using Diana\u2019s sighting to make himself sound fully cleared, but Diana only confirms he came from electrical into security \u2014 not what happened in electrical before he left. I\u2019m not saying Charlie definitely did it, but this \u201cFrank had the cleanest opportunity\u201d argument is ignoring that both Charlie and Eve still have possible windows.\n\nI think voting me here is a mistake based on route overlap, not proof. My strongest suspicion is Eve self-report, with Charlie second."}}
